        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-30T15:24:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For vboot ec (as proposed in the subsequent patches), charge manager needs to know current_ma and voltage_mv to answer the question of whether the system is powered enough to boot AP. This query is sent during HOOK_INIT thus task manager need to update current_ma and voltage_mv without deferred tasks, which run after HOOK_INIT.",
      "parentUuid": "445567cd_fe1fe952",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 32,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "bad83da0767a21e882cb3c43b684e13c6723c52c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "38f2834f_c6a15ee6",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 12,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000016
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-30T15:29:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On other systems, we defer this decision for later than HOOK_INIT\n(at this point, you haven\u0027t even finished your USB-C negotiation)",
      "parentUuid": "d9f90a26_a5db8ffb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
